File name: WCCRLOO2.MP
Path description: Easy Nanati diamond gathering loop.
Path starts: White Corridor
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 8 
Level recommendation: 45+
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: nanati, nanati bladesman, nanati shadow, nanati
                      sorceress, nanati deathweaver

Additional information:

Included in the zip are DHELWCRS.MP and WCRSDHEL.MP which are paths
to and from the start of this loop.

If you play SOLO Recommended for over level 45.  A spellcaster should set
each monster for two casts of your most powerful combat spell.
Avoids the very dark areas and the Lady of the Dark.  If you have no night
vision will require 5 light sources, 1,000 illumination, so it is best
done in a party, but can be done by a solo player, you will just rest a lot
until the darkeness wears off.

